%% CTU-Service Ingestion Pipeline Flowchart
%% Complete ingestion workflow from upload to published

flowchart TD
    Start([Upload Document]) --> Job[Create Ingestion Job]
    Job --> OCR[OCR with ocr-pvl]
    OCR --> Clean[Markdown Cleaning]
    Clean --> Meta[Complete Metadata]
    Meta --> Validate{Validate<br/>Metadata}
    Validate -->|Invalid| Fix[Fix Errors]
    Fix --> Meta
    Validate -->|Valid| Review{Human<br/>Review}
    Review -->|Reject| End1([Rejected])
    Review -->|Approve| Chunk[LangChain Chunking]
    Chunk --> Embed[BGE-M3 Embedding]
    Embed --> Index[Qdrant Indexing]
    Index --> Publish[Set rag_status=published]
    Publish --> End2([Active in RAG])

%% Reference: .docs/spec/ctu-service/08_OCR_INGESTION_SPEC.md
